  "kicker": {
    "zh": "开发中",
    "en": "In development"
  },
  "lede": {
    "zh": "一章一章造出视觉的机器。先造一台相机：把场景投影成像素、在任意位置取值；再造一台卷积器：把邻居加权合起来，搭出模糊器和边缘检测器。每个部件都会在后面直接复用。",
    "en": "Build the machines of vision chapter by chapter. First a camera: project a scene into pixels and read it at any position; then a convolver: weigh neighbours together into a blur and an edge detector. Every part is reused later."
  },
